  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, a mageknight can use mental and physical resiliency to avoid certain attacks. If she succeeds at a Fortitude or Will saving throw against an attack that has a reduced effect on a successful save, she instead avoids the effect entirely. A helpless mageknight does not gain the benefit of the stalwart ability.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mageknight#toc72\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
